USAIGE | Building the AI Operating System for Physical Spaces (Legacy v1)
"WiFi-Sensing is our input; intelligent infrastructure is our outcome."

This repository contains the v1 foundation of what has evolved into the AI Operating System for Physical Spaces. We began by mastering Channel State Information (CSI) extraction to prove that physical environments can be digitized with absolute privacy, using only existing radio frequency disturbances.

