🛠 Technical Legacy (v1)
The code in this repository represents our "Gen-1" architecture:

CSI Extraction: Initial implementation of packet capture using ESP32 microcontrollers.

Signal Filtering: Basic noise reduction to isolate human movement signatures.

Presence Logic: Binary classification for privacy-first space occupancy.

Note: Our current Gen-5 architecture features advanced Edge-AI denoising and multi-target tracking. This IP is maintained in private repositories to protect our competitive advantage during our $300,000 USD pre-seed round.

